  "summary": "I’m a senior software developer with extensive experience designing and building modern web applications, single-page applications, APIs, and microservices.\n\nMy primary expertise is in JavaScript and Node.js, with strong experience across both backend and frontend development. Throughout my career, I’ve worked with technologies including React, Node.js, JavaScript, PHP, SQL, and Microsoft SQL Server, building scalable applications and services that solve real-world business problems.\n\nI enjoy taking complex requirements and turning them into practical, maintainable software. My experience spans application architecture, API and microservice development, database design, frontend development, system integrations, and the modernization of existing applications.\n\nMore recently, I’ve been expanding my focus into AI-powered applications and services, including integrating large language models and AI APIs into traditional software systems. I’m particularly interested in how AI can be used to automate workflows, transform existing business data into useful experiences, and create new types of software products.\n\nCore technologies and areas of experience include:\n• JavaScript / TypeScript\n• Node.js\n• React\n• REST APIs & Microservices\n• Microsoft SQL Server / SQL\n• PHP\n• HTML / CSS\n• Application & Database Architecture\n• Cloud Services & Integrations\n• AI / LLM API Integration",
